# bin/pemutar/ is a dev-machine build toolchain (PRD-jalur-scratch §8): its
# output, aset/scratch/pemutar.js, is committed and already covered by
# COPY aset/ below. node_modules/ is gitignored and never in a clean clone,
# but this is a free safety net if the image is ever built from a local
# working copy that still has it on disk — several hundred MB that has no
# business in a PHP runtime image.
node_modules/
